#showas: rogue 獾
This is a roguelike game. The key is that you don't know what factions exist until you encounter them.

You must explore in order to know what enemies await you.

Please don't load this into the Lobby or it will spoil the surprise.

This has been modified to start with two Difficulty 7 AIs of a random type, and three pure random factions with random allegiances, and brutal, hard, and moderate impact. Your starting fleet, battlestations and support fleet are also all random.